## Build & Test Commands

### Installation
```bash
uv sync
uv add package-name
```

### Code Quality
```bash
make format     # or: uv run black src tests
make lint       # or: uv run ruff check src tests
make typecheck  # or: uv run mypy src
make precommit  # Run all checks
```

### Testing
```bash
make test       # or: uv run pytest -q
uv run pytest tests/test_trading_logic.py::test_place_order -v
uv run pytest --cov=src --cov-report=html
```

### Running
```bash
uv run python main.py
uv run python main.py --mode live --dry-run
make run-api    # or: uv run uvicorn src.app.main:app --reload
```

